    <title>Familiar Attractions</title>
    <link>https://coverager.com/familiar-attractions/</link>
    <description>Aon&amp;#8217;s announcement of its megadeal to acquire USI for $17 billion has everyone looking at the middle. It increased its investment in 2020, 2023 and 2025 and is realizing a 6x multiple on its original 2017 investment— or a 3.4x multiple on all KKR balance-sheet capital invested over the life of the investment . As the saying goes, there&amp;#8217;s no view without a point of view.</description>
