    <title>Mercury Highlights Wildfire Mitigation Discounts</title>
    <link>https://iireporter.com/mercury-highlights-wildfire-mitigation-discounts/</link>
    <description>(Image source: IIR.) Mercury Insurance (Los Angeles) is encouraging homeowners to review wildfire mitigation improvements and consult their insurance agents about discounts that may be available. Mercury says qualifying homeowners may be eligible for wildfire mitigation discounts in multiple states where the insurer writes homeowners coverage. In California, qualifying Mercury customers may receive discounts based on measures such as defensible space, home hardening, IBHS Wildfire Prepared Home certification, qualifying community mitigation and certain types of fire-resistive construction.</description>
    <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 20:15:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <guid>https://iireporter.com/mercury-highlights-wildfire-mitigation-discounts/</guid>
