    <title>ICEYE &amp; The Water Institute partner to advance predictive flood intelligence</title>
    <link>https://www.reinsurancene.ws/iceye-the-water-institute-partner-to-advance-predictive-flood-intelligence/</link>
    <description>ICEYE, a company that operates the world’s largest synthetic aperture radar (SAR) satellite constellation, has partnered with The Water Institute to bring predictive flood intelligence platform FloodID, and its core development team to ICEYE. During active floods, ICEYE’s SAR constellation delivers near real-time intelligence through cloud cover, rain, and darkness, providing observed flood extent, water depth, and building-level damage data within hours via Flood Rapid Impact and Flood Insights. ICEYE’s persistent observation combined with FloodID’s predictive intelligence supports pre-event preparedness, operational decisions during events, and post-event recovery.</description>
